      "text": "I am thy shield, Gen. 15:1. Lord, the shield of thy help, Deut. 33:29. he is my shield, 2 Sam. 22:3. given me the shield of thy salvation, 2 Sam. 22:36 (Ps. 18:35). he made … shields of beaten gold, 1 Kgs. 10:17 (2 Chr. 9:16). thou, O Lord, art a shield for me, Ps. 3:3. Lord: he is our help and our shield, Ps. 33:20. shields of the earth belong unto God, Ps. 47:9. God is a sun and shield, Ps. 84:11. his truth shall be thy shield, Ps. 91:4. God … is a shield unto them that put their trust in him, Prov. 30:5.",
